      },
      "supersedes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "BILL-15-R2",
      "statement": "`show <invoice>` shows the reminder fee after the late fee: `i1 c1 amount 100.00, late fee 2.00, reminder fee 5.00, paid 0.00, outstanding 107.00, due 2026-04-01`. Acceptance criteria: each statement above holds; the standing requirements in `README.md` hold; existing behaviour is unchanged except as these requirements say; `dotnet test Billing.slnx` passes.",
      "status": "accepted",
